		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Animated statue of a sword maiden. Simple golem, used as temple and tomb guards.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 13, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 longsword +2 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Column</strong>. When standing still, looks exactly like a statue.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Immune to damage from fire, cold, electricity, or non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shatter Weapon</strong>. Weapons striking caryatid shatter on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
